[break] a-late-line-is-kept-as-plain
rule: A code line committed plain because its colours were late is recorded as late, so that a redraw asks for them again.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/markdown/mod.rs
in: flush
find: (Vec::new(), None)
replace: (Vec::new(), Some(Vec::new()))
caught-by:
    cortex-tui highlight::tests::a_kept_answer_records_its_code_colours_and_the_lines_that_were_late

[break] a-kept-source-drops-text
rule: A kept answer keeps every piece of its text as it arrived.
file: crates/cortex-tui/src/markdown/mod.rs
in: push
find: keep.text.push_str(text);
replace: keep.text = text.to_owned();
caught-by:
    cortex-tui markdown::tests::a_kept_answer_draws_again_what_its_stream_committed

[break] the-mouse-on-the-main-screen
rule: The mouse is reported only while the alternate screen is shown, never on the main screen.
